Q: What ConvertNonemptyCellsTextURLsToHyperlinks VB program do?

A: This script processes the current Excel sheet and converts all non-empty cells with text URLs into active links.

Q: What FormatNonEmptyCells VB program do?

A: This script processes the current Excel sheet and do 2 things:

1.  Apply all borders to non-empty cells
2. Make only non-empty cells in row 1 bold
